### Alternate Screen Buffer Example

Source: https://github.com/vadimdemedes/ink/blob/master/_autodocs/configuration.md

Example of enabling the alternate screen buffer for rendering.

```typescript
render(<App />, {
  alternateScreen: true,
  interactive: true
});
```

--------------------------------

### Responsive Layout

Source: https://github.com/vadimdemedes/ink/blob/master/_autodocs/README.md

Example of using `useWindowSize` hook to create a responsive layout.

```typescript
const {columns, rows} = useWindowSize();

return (
  <Box width={columns} height={rows} flexDirection="column">
    <Text>{columns} x {rows}</Text>
  </Box>
);

```

--------------------------------

### useWindowSize

Source: https://github.com/vadimdemedes/ink/blob/master/readme.md

Example of using `useWindowSize` to display terminal dimensions.

```js
import {Text, useWindowSize} from 'ink';

const Example = () => {
	const {columns, rows} = useWindowSize();

	return (
		<Text>
			{columns}x{rows}
		</Text>
	);
};
```

--------------------------------

### Header/Footer Layout

Source: https://github.com/vadimdemedes/ink/blob/master/_autodocs/api-reference/Spacer.md

Example of using Spacers for header and footer layouts.

```typescript
<Box flexDirection="column" height={20}>
  <Box>
    <Text bold>MyApp</Text>
    <Spacer />
    <Text color="gray">v2.0</Text>
  </Box>

  <Spacer />

  <Box>
    <Text dimColor>Press ? for help</Text>
    <Spacer />
    <Text dimColor>Ctrl+C to exit</Text>
  </Box>
</Box>
```

--------------------------------

### Basic Layout

